    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"A seminar titled \"\"Update on Asthma\"\" was organized by the Aga Khan University (AKU) on December 6, to support \"\"World Asthma Day\"\" on December 11, 1998. The seminar was attended by physicians, medical students and other healthcare professionals from across the country.",
